// weapsel.gui: centre-screen weapon selector for the D-pad weapon groups (C5b). Four arms around
// the crosshair (left/up/right/down = groups 0..3), up to four cells each. idPlayer::DrawWeaponSel
// sets per cell wsel_G_N_vis (0 hidden, 1 square icon, 2 wide icon), _icon, _ammo, _sel, _empty,
// and wsel_alpha for the fade. Generated layout; cells are 64x48 in 640x480 virtual space.
//
// This file is a new addition with dhewm3-rt.  It was created with the aid of GenAI,
// and may reference the existing Dhewm3 OpenGL and vkDoom3 Vulkan updates of the Doom 3 GPL Source
// Code.
//
// It is distributed under the same modified GNU General Public License Version 3 of the original Doom 3 GPL Source
// Code release.

